        "original_id": "5facd477-1e6d-58da-80d8-f04da49da9f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian May, Anita Dobson\n- Songs: \"Too Much Love Will Kill You\", \"Anyone Can Fall in Love\"\n- Topics: marriage breakdown, romantic attraction, UK Singles Chart, EastEnders theme music\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Anita Dobson reached number four in the UK Singles Chart with \"Anyone Can Fall in Love\".\n- \"Anyone Can Fall in Love\" was based on the theme music of \"EastEnders\".\n- \"Too Much Love Will Kill You\" reflected the breakdown of Brian May's first marriage.\n- \"Too Much Love Will Kill You\" also reflected Brian May's attraction to his future wife, Anita Dobson.",
